# FlyRank Backend Internship - Task API

## 📌 Project Overview

This project is a simple Task Management CRUD API built using **Python** and **FastAPI** as part of the FlyRank Backend Internship assignment.

The API allows users to create, read, update, and delete tasks using RESTful endpoints.

---

## 🚀 Features

- View all tasks
- View a single task by ID
- Create a new task
- Update an existing task
- Delete a task

---

## 🛠 Technologies Used

- Python 3
- FastAPI
- Uvicorn
- Git
- GitHub

